# Requests for the weaviate-monitor HTTP API.
# Start the service first: `make up` (Weaviate), then `make run`.

@host = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### Health of the monitor service itself
GET {{host}}/healthz

### Liveness of the Weaviate cluster (200 when up, 503 when degraded or down)
GET {{host}}/api/liveness
